{"seq":9,"slug":"legged-mobile-robots","title":"腿足与移动机器人","stage":"DONE","category":"robotics-automation","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots","rating":{"composite":3.74,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 腿足与移动机器人\n\n让一台机器自己移动，看似只是\"装上轮子或腿让它走\"，背后却是一整套相互咬合的工程：它得知道自己在哪、脚下是什么、怎样不摔倒、如何把意图变成每个关节的力。这个 hub 沿着一条由浅入深的主线，把移动机器人——尤其是技术难度最高的腿足与人形——从地基讲到现实。\n\n四章构成一条清晰的递进。第一章「移动机器人基础」立地基：先用运动学把车轮约束翻译成位姿如何演化，再对比轮式与履带式平台的地面力学权衡，最后用定位与里程计回答\"我在哪\"这个一切自主的前提。这一章里固定的接触、连续的轮子，是后面理解腿式之难的对照参照。\n\n第二章「腿足机器人」完成关键跨越：把轮式那种固定接触，升级成可离散切换的落足。它先讲腿的机构与步态如何编排多腿的着地节律，再讲动态平衡的判据——ZMP、捕获点、线性倒立摆——为什么动起来就不能只看重心，最后落到双足与四足各自的经典控制架构。这一章解释了腿足为何值得付出巨大的控制代价，也提出了后续要解的核心问题。\n\n第三章「运动控制」是技术深水区，把\"该怎么动\"变成\"关节输出多少力\"。全身控制与 MPC 用统一优化取代手工分配，力控与柔顺运动让机器人懂得调力而非硬追位置，学习驱动运动控制则用强化学习与 sim-to-real 绕开难以建模的接触与扰动。三者并非互斥，2026 年的主流正是模型与学习的融合。\n\n第四章「系统与应用」让前三章接受现实检验：感知与地形适应把\"看到的\"和\"踩到的\"融合成落足决策，人形机器人把全 hub 技术叠在一起、正于 2026 年迈过产业拐点，应用与挑战则诚实盘点已落地的工业巡检与工厂场景，以及能耗、可靠性、泛化、成本、安全这五道还没算平的账。\n\n读这个 hub，建议顺着「基础→腿足→控制→应用」走一遍：每一章都为下一章提供语言与判据，越往后越能看清，腿足机器人从\"能演示\"到\"能干活\"的门槛，是被一项项硬功夫一寸寸推过去的。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"移动机器人基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mobile-kinematics","title":"移动机器人运动学","url":"/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/foundations/mobile-kinematics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"wheeled-tracked","title":"轮式与履带式平台","url":"/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/foundations/wheeled-tracked"},{"seq":3,"slug":"localization-odometry","title":"定位与里程计","url":"/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/foundations/localization-odometry"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"legged","title":"腿足机器人","docCount":3,"url":"/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/legged","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"leg-mechanisms-gait","title":"腿足机构与步态","url":"/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/legged/leg-mechanisms-gait"},{"seq":2,"slug":"balance-dynamic-stability","title":"平衡与动态稳定","url":"/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/legged/balance-dynamic-stability"},{"seq":3,"slug":"biped-quadruped-control","title":"双足与四足控制","url":"/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/legged/biped-quadruped-control"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"control","title":"运动控制","docCount":3,"url":"/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/control","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"whole-body-mpc","title":"全身控制与 MPC","url":"/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/control/whole-body-mpc"},{"seq":2,"slug":"force-compliant-locomotion","title":"力控与柔顺运动","url":"/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/control/force-compliant-locomotion"},{"seq":3,"slug":"learning-locomotion","title":"学习驱动运动控制","url":"/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/control/learning-locomotion"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"系统与应用","docCount":3,"url":"/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"perception-terrain","title":"感知与地形适应","url":"/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/applications/perception-terrain"},{"seq":2,"slug":"humanoid-robots","title":"人形机器人","url":"/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/applications/humanoid-robots"},{"seq":3,"slug":"applications-challenges","title":"应用与挑战","url":"/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/applications/applications-challenges"}]}]}